<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>BALTAP - Minesweeping Kiel Bight, 1983</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;The Soviets started an attack by surprise. They took Bornholm and their air force is currently attacking Zealand. No major naval surface combatants involved in this offensive so far.&amp;nbsp;Heavy air raids are expected&amp;nbsp;on all military bases in Northern Germany.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Germany's fleet in the Baltic has to be dislocated from their naval bases&amp;nbsp;to designated CSP's in Kattegat north of Danish Islands.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT size=4&gt;Your mission will be to evacuate the ships&amp;nbsp;from their harbours through possible minefields and protect them from air raids and sub attacks.&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;FONT color=#0080ff size=4&gt;*****************&lt;BR&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;FONT color=#0080ff size=3&gt;&lt;EM&gt;The minesweeping operations require some micro-management.&lt;BR&gt;Air action starts immediately - get a good overview of situation and your assets before starting the scenario.&lt;/EM&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
  <Complexity>4</Complexity>
  <Difficulty>4</Difficulty>
  <ScenSetting>Western Baltic</ScenSetting>
